      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "3",
          "section": "3.3 Microstructural evolution results from deformation",
          "quote": "Hence, it could be concluded that {112} <111> mechanical twinning is the predominant deformation mechanism of the VNbTa alloy when deformed at cryogenic temperatures.",
