          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "5fba32fea14600cd:part:001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_3",
      "name": "dislocation interaction and entanglement",
      "category": "deformation",
      "sample_id": "sample_2",
      "material_state": "deformed at 77 K",
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "4",
          "section": "4. Discussion",
          "quote": "Therefore, the excellent mechanical properties of VNbTa MEA at 77 K should also consider the contribution of dislocation interaction and entanglement, which can obstruct the dislocation movement and cause continuous grain fragmentation.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "5fba32fea14600cd:part:001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_4",
      "name": "cross-slip of screw dislocation",
      "category": "deformation",
      "sample_id": "sample_2",
      "material_state": "deformed at 77 K",
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "4",
          "section": "4. Discussion",
          "quote": "During the deformation of VNbTa specimens, the severe lattice distortion increases the local lattice friction, which can restrain dislocation motion along the initial silp plane, inducing the cross-slips of basal dislocations to suppress strain localization. Eventually, the continuing cross-slip of dislocations causes serious dislocation interactions, resulting in an intense strain hardening ability [47–49].",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "5fba32fea14600cd:part:001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_5",
      "name": "dynamic Hall-Petch effect",
      "category": "strengthening",
      "sample_id": "sample_2",
      "material_state": "deformed at 77 K",
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "4",
          "section": "4. Discussion",
          "quote": "Consequentially, this dynamic Hall-Petch effect results in the enhancement of mechanical properties.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
